  "description": "SORLAO crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C84 H112 Br4 N4 Nd4 O52 Zn8,2(C4 H10 O1),2(C2 H6 O1),C1 H4 O1,2(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Nd1 (Nd) has 9 O neighbors; Nd2 (Nd) has 9 O neighbors; Zn1 (Zn) has 3 O neighbors; Zn2 (Zn) has 4 O neighbors; Zn3 (Zn) has 4 O neighbors; Zn4 (Zn) has 3 O neighbors; Nd1A (Nd) has 9 O neighbors; Nd2A (Nd) has 9 O neighbors; Zn1A (Zn) has 3 O neighbors; Zn2A (Zn) has 4 O neighbors; Zn3A (Zn) has 4 O neighbors; Zn4A (Zn) has 3 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 14 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.654-4.191 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 107.80-118.84°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Nd4Zn8(L2)2(OAc)20(OH)4]. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 20 OAc (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 4 OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
